      "title": "Two NSGs, one packet",
      "exam": "AZ-104",
      "brief": "HTTPS to the web VM is allowed on the subnet, yet customers get timeouts. Inbound traffic must pass the **subnet NSG first, then the NIC NSG**. Find what blocks it and fix it, without opening anything else.",
